        "created_at": "2020-06-07T04:48:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In another thread, it was clarified that \"multiple targets\" applies is limited to targets at a single location (when encounter is spread over multiple locations). So how is \"multiple close targets\" differ from just \"multipe targets\"?</p>",
